# Normalize line endings for every text file to LF, both in the repository and
# in the working tree.
#
# Prettier writes LF (its default), so on Windows — where core.autocrlf=true
# checks files out as CRLF — every `npm run format` rewrote the line endings of
# every file in the repo on disk. Pinning the working tree to LF makes format
# runs a no-op for files that did not actually change, and overrides whatever
# core.autocrlf each developer has set locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize, never diff as text.
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
